OL,3,GNEWSABaby bank offers warm winter
OL,4,Aclothes to families
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother says she is "very happy" that
OL,7,Fa baby bank has provided warm winter
OL,8,Fclothes for her children after she and
OL,9,Fher partner, who are both unemployed,
OL,10,Fused it for the first time.
OL,12,FBakhtawar Wajid turned to Wolverhampton
OL,13,FBaby Bank as it received a record
OL,14,Fnumber of donations for its Winter
OL,15,FWarmth scheme, which supports families
OL,16,Fstruggling to keep their children warm.
OL,18,F"I'm very happy, and my children are
OL,19,Fhappy. They wear the [coats] to school,
OL,20,Fand they feel very warm," said the
OL,21,Fmother-of-four.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
