OL,3,GNEWSABaby bank offers warm winter
OL,4,Aclothes to families
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity received about 50% more
OL,7,Fitems of clothing than a year ago, when
OL,8,Fit received about 2,000 items. It
OL,9,Festimates this year's total could reach
OL,10,F4,000 items.
